      "writtenOn": "2021-03-29T09:41:59Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Do I understand correctly that this is needed becuse moduleBase.variableProperties is an interface{}? This code assumes that whatever that field is set to has a Product_variables field, but then why not just declare that field to be of the right type instead of interface{} ?",
